          "guid": "msxur7zztv5smnx6",
          "message": {
            "text": "An exact Linux Tamil A/B on run 32079382535 changed all three embedded entries from svg2ttf to retained-gid hb-subset and reduced the stable 26-region failure to zero coherent regions. The workflow and CLI already documented an empty input as inheriting a default-on renderer, but ba4144b3 had temporarily changed both implementation gates to opt-in. Later CFF and retained-gid fixes removed the correctness hazards behind that rollback, so restoring absent-or-1 as production behavior fixes the shared complex-script raster class without script or codepoint exceptions.",
            "markdown": "An exact Linux Tamil A/B on run 32079382535 changed all three embedded entries from svg2ttf to retained-gid hb-subset and reduced the stable 26-region failure to zero coherent regions. The workflow and CLI already documented an empty input as inheriting a default-on renderer, but ba4144b3 had temporarily changed both implementation gates to opt-in. Later CFF and retained-gid fixes removed the correctness hazards behind that rollback, so restoring absent-or-1 as production behavior fixes the shared complex-script raster class without script or codepoint exceptions."
          },
          "locations": [
            {
              "physicalLocation": {
                "artifactLocation": {
                  "uri": "src/render/embedded-font-builder.ts"
                },
                "region": {
                  "startLine": 43,
                  "endLine": 49,
                  "snippet": {
                    "text": "/** DM-1714/DM-1716: the hinting-preserving hb-subset embedded path is the\n *  default. Set DOMOTION_HINTED_SUBSET=0 to use the svg2ttf-only control arm.\n *  The retained-gid builder keeps bytecode glyph references stable; entries\n *  that cannot safely preserve their source tables fall back independently. */\nfunction hintedSubsetEnabled(): boolean {\n  return process.env.DOMOTION_HINTED_SUBSET !== \"0\";\n}"
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          ],
          "properties": {
